  "#1": "form-data dependency below to workaround: https://github.com/SophistSolutions/Stroika/security/dependabot/27",
  "#2": "glob dependency below to workaround: https://github.com/SophistSolutions/Stroika/security/dependabot/36",
  "#3": "node-forge dependency below to workaround: https://github.com/SophistSolutions/Stroika/security/dependabot/39",
  "#4": "qs dependency below to workaround: https://github.com/SophistSolutions/Stroika/security/dependabot/40",
  "#5": "esbuild override below to workaround GHSA-g7r4-m6w7-qqqr (dev-server arbitrary file read, windows): @quasar/app-vite 2.x pins esbuild ^0.27.4, which cannot reach the fixed 0.28.1+. vite 8 already accepts ^0.28. Remove this override once @quasar/app-vite is upgraded to 3.x, which drops its esbuild dependency entirely.",
